# #167 Lich King Defile: a shadow pool ahead of him on frame 20 that strikes b standing in it and
# grows with each hit; b jumps out. lich-king-defile.pad covers the recast wait and facings.
# Lich King a against Lich King b. Syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero lich king
# Input starts after frame 500: on a loaded host the helpers first see a quick match up to ~400 frames in.
# b dashes in, then walks 22 frames toward a, to where the pool lands.
540 b stick -1 0
560 b stick 0 0
590 b press LB
590 b stick -1 0
612 b stick 0 0
612 b release LB
660 a stick 0 -1
660 a tap X 2
661 a stick 0 0
669 a capture
674 a capture
679 a capture
696 a capture
697 a capture
702 a capture
708 a capture
732 a capture
733 a capture
744 a capture
768 a capture
769 a capture
780 a capture
# b presses jump while still in hitstun, so it dashes out of the pool instead.
780 b tap B 8
780 b stick 1 0
800 b stick 0 0
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
#! scene a ImpactDefile
# Expected: the pool strikes b every 36 frames from its age 18; b's dash out ends the hits.
#! expect a 660 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 696 damage 2.000
#! expect b 732 damage 4.000
#! expect b 768 damage 6.000
#! expect b 781 ground action 1 facing 1
#! absent b 769-860 damage
